athogenesis. </span></a></li><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R1-5" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>e [...] turn symptomatic in response to exercise, </span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="biblioentry" data-has="label"><div class="label">2.</div><div id="R2" class="citations"><div class="citation"><div class="citation-content">Vahanian A, Beyersdorf F, Praz F, Milojevic M, Baldus S, Bauersachs J, Capodanno D, Conradi L, De Bonis M, De Paulis R, et al. 2021 ESC/EACTS Guidelines for the management of valvular heart disease [published online August 28, 2021]. <em>Eur Heart J</em>. doi: 10.1093/eurheartj/ehab395</div><div class="external-links"><div class="to-citation__wrapper"><button class="to-citation__toggle" aria-controls="to-citation__accordion-R2" data-trigger="dropdown" aria-label="Toggle citations menu"><i class="icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="accordion__toggle__title" data-expand-title="Hide Citations" data-collapsed-title="Show Citations"></span></button></div><div class="core-xlink-crossref"><a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehab395">Crossref</a></div><div class="core-xlink-google-scholar"><a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?title=2021+ESC%2FEACTS+Guidelines+for+the+management+of+valvular+heart+disease+%5Bpublished+online+August+28%2C+2021%5D.&amp;author=A+Vahanian&amp;author=F+Beyersdorf&amp;author=F+Praz&amp;author=M+Milojevic&amp;author=S+Baldus&amp;author=J+Bauersachs&amp;author=D+Capodanno&amp;author=L+Conradi&amp;author=M+De+Bonis&amp;author=R+De+Paulis&amp;journal=Eur+Heart+J&amp;doi=10.1093%2Feurheartj%2Fehab395">Google Scholar</a></div><div class="to-citation__accordion no-separator" id="to-citation__accordion-R2" role="menu" aria-label="Citations links" style="display: none;"><ul role="none"><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R2-1" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>a [...] to relieve symptoms and improve survival. </span></a></li><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R2-2" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>b [...] left ventricular (LV) systolic dysfunction. </span></a></li><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R2-3" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>c [...] to standard echocardiographic criteria </span></a></li><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R2-4" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>d [...] predominantly degenerative pathogenesis. </span></a></li><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R2-5" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>e [...] turn symptomatic in response to exercise, </span></a></li><li role="none"><a class="to-citation" href="https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639#core-R2-6" target="_self" role="menuitem"><i class="icon-return" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>f [...] intervention in the most recent guidelines. </span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="biblioentry" data-has="label"><div class="label">3.</div><div id="R3" class="citations"><div class="citation"><div class="citation-content">Carabello BA. Should severe aortic stenosis be operated on before symptom onset? Aortic valve replacement should be operated on before symptom onset. <em>Circulation</em>. 2012;126:112–117. doi: 10.1161/CIRCULATIONA