        <section id="comments"><div class="comments__wrapper__header"><div class="article__body"><h2 class="comments__title"><span>eLetters</span><span class="comments__count"></span></h2></div><p>eLetters should relate to an article recently published in the journal and are not a forum for providing unpublished data. Comments are reviewed for appropriate use of tone and language. Comments are not peer-reviewed. Acceptable comments are posted to the journal website only. Comments are not published in an issue and are not indexed in PubMed. Comments should be no longer than 500 words and will only be posted online. References are limited to 10. Authors of the article cited in the comment will be invited to reply, as appropriate.</p><p>Comments and feedback on AHA/ASA Scientific Statements and Guidelines should be directed to the AHA/ASA Manuscript Oversight Committee via its <a href="https://professional.heart.org/en/guidelines-and-statements/correspondence" target="_blank">Correspondence</a> page.</p><div class="comments__add-comment"><a href="https://www.ahajournals.org/action/ssostart?idp=https://ahasso.heart.org&amp;redirectUri=/doi/full/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.121.057639" class="btn btn--primary"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" focusable="false"><path d="M12.333 0.333252H1.66634C0.929675 0.333252 0.333008 0.929919 0.333008 1.66659V13.6666L2.99967 10.9999H12.333C13.0697 10.9999 13.6663 10.4033 13.6663 9.66659V1.66659C13.6663 0.929919 13.0697 0.333252 12.333 0.333252Z" fill="white"></path></svg><span>Sign In to Submit a Response to This Article</span></a></div></div></section>










    
    
